<title>JAPAN: TSE says suspends Tokai Kogyo from trade.</title>
<headline>TSE says suspends Tokai Kogyo from trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokai Kogyo Co Ltd shares were suspended from trade on the Tokyo bourse on Friday afternoon, the exchange announced.  </p>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) also said it had suspended trade in Tokai Kogyo shares.</p>
<p>By the time of the suspension, the shares had traded 19 yen lower at 285.</p>
</text>
